            <div xml:id="m-8b16b3ca-3661-40fd-967a-feac42da23c8">
              <lg xml:id="m-ed7ac8fb-a875-4a8a-85a8-a4aebd8d9c38">
                <l xml:id="m-1b65fd5a-fb03-4ec5-9654-f45c408c291b" facs="#m-3b955c52-79e8-45aa-842e-2e524a50695d" label="ambiguous">Friday in Easter Week.</l><l xml:id="m-be93202d-8233-43d3-9049-8adb8a831b80" facs="#m-87a26d17-42a6-4224-895f-a9aa2ffc84a0" label="ambiguous">s03</l><l xml:id="m-bee1b68f-c091-4bc6-8104-d64dad254f9d" facs="#m-aab76db8-34a5-409f-a8f5-14b5473079ea" label="lyrics-like">lú- ia, al-le¬</l><l xml:id="m-44ffb3c6-cc9f-4cef-9c30-07c6f4e78c72" facs="#m-e2e72582-fa99-4fe5-9a5f-2464f225bc92" label="lyrics-like">lú-ia,</l><l xml:id="m-3575c2bc-30e6-42b2-bcfe-05b041ec988d" facs="#m-ed4b6b0f-e4bf-46ba-8bfe-f454ea08f211" label="ambiguous">alle¬</l><l xml:id="m-d69b3d0b-d798-4032-bd82-e7a073620bca" facs="#m-fed86a53-414d-40e2-b29b-9d4e8d0a322b" label="lyrics-like">lú¬ ia</l><l xml:id="m-e41523ff-7c89-47e9-88a7-627f40003b3f" facs="#m-ecf5672e-bf5b-4e5c-b290-6f046f20a11d" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-e0f15de1-0dc1-4c4e-94bc-5d129a5732cf" facs="#m-86b31ae6-7b68-44d0-b304-638f172899be" label="lyrics-like">Ostias, quaésumus Dómine, rimus, et pro acceleratióne caelé¬</l><l xml:id="m-43e093c1-f4d8-475f-9dfb-3bb55f7fda92" facs="#m-7c51a755-2628-494c-9e7e-e68e54f5d999" label="lyrics-like">It placátus assúme: quas et pro stis auxflii. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-467b5c2f-acb6-4d6c-aa03-8b009ed2a883" facs="#m-b62109e9-cf21-46e6-a886-c4ede91fdb07" label="lyrics-like">renatórum expiatióne peccáti defé¬</l><l xml:id="m-f032d3df-5b73-4781-9a28-6de21a95a3ef" facs="#m-41879075-f6ad-492b-8f8d-a5bc8c71f085" label="text-like">2. for the Church or for the Pope, p. 822.</l><l xml:id="m-6ddf9620-6e66-4cbc-a19b-ad52753bf7b0" facs="#m-d87494fd-e569-4100-b2c5-d3a8a9080e27" label="text-like">Preface. Easter Sunday. p. 8.</l><l xml:id="m-9ad1eea2-2ab9-498c-b9d7-873561e0a3df" facs="#m-34254f0d-0311-4936-b188-cb6f6d4cec56" label="ambiguous">comm.g</l><l xml:id="m-b164a3dc-96ff-4f25-89c9-b5075de63789" facs="#m-6ac96ab4-21a2-450d-9f64-29cb46fde52f" label="ambiguous">1.</l><l xml:id="m-f638df34-b96b-454f-95bf-78fd71076645" facs="#m-7490b6ee-8f41-485e-82cb-8bb5285d836d" label="lyrics-like">DAta est míhi "“ómnis pot-é-stas in caélo</l><l xml:id="m-5742abca-1dd3-4134-a75a-3bad65d9d9f8" facs="#m-b6bd8b24-cea7-4bf3-bb48-fe9483f0e311" label="ambiguous">et in</l><l xml:id="m-c0a12bd2-17e4-463b-8839-a0dffa8764fe" facs="#m-c5a3b20f-8dda-4b60-9612-3390b1d4b432" label="lyrics-like">térra, alle- lú- ia: e-úntes, docé-te ómnes gén-tes,</l><l xml:id="m-76ea2763-4459-4815-9452-d0224569da32" facs="#m-8beeb68e-f1c4-41f6-b0ae-44c30f3cfd08" label="lyrics-like">baptizántes é-o in nó-mi-ne Pá-tris, et Fi¬ li¬</l><l xml:id="m-2abe7f16-09d6-4e1d-b2b7-85ec3077a474" facs="#m-b2027d8b-2b48-43a7-b1ec-51b72cb8401d" label="lyrics-like">et Spi-ri-tus Sáncti,</l><l xml:id="m-b0276490-b583-494e-8cb2-afbcd0d55e11" facs="#m-dbd40b86-dba4-4612-a9a5-34f8287d6863" label="lyrics-like">alle-lú- ia, alle¬</l><l xml:id="m-82890fc9-d99a-452b-9b75-6e916cca75cd" facs="#m-af79a7d3-23ad-4ad5-8603-405db674cf28" label="lyrics-like">lú- ia.</l><l xml:id="m-ec1ecba1-c1bd-436a-8642-a044b65b493e" facs="#m-eb368484-8a97-4678-8f3a-890311ecc656" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-b75ce966-a2c4-4a14-8126-3469df9b0922" facs="#m-04419b7f-76ee-4ebd-9bb4-3d5d676fe56e" label="lyrics-like">Espice, quaésumus Dómine, la temporálibus culpis dignánter</l><l xml:id="m-b87f7fc1-1994-4b0f-8456-952d6ac398d1" facs="#m-caab6b2f-edeb-485e-ab17-9f85cd14237b" label="lyrics-like">It pópulum tuum : et quem aetér-]absólve. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-9196dd91-f77c-485a-94d6-2b068b1bdf32" facs="#m-4b90379b-7b09-4dca-9169-5e05a8d1e903" label="lyrics-like">nis dignátus es renováre mystériis,</l><l xml:id="m-684feb71-2a2a-4e05-9494-8d1bdb7ef4bc" facs="#m-e941be93-c8ce-4dc9-a6d7-2849861f41e1" label="text-like">2. for the Church or for the Pope, p. 823.</l><l xml:id="m-d8baf6db-8e7c-4b2b-b9a2-0c3ecf403a30" facs="#m-28bff02e-c086-4c2d-9787-c045e0fbc8b5" label="text-like">AT VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-83a43fd4-4153-4578-98b8-d612bede629e" facs="#m-42c7774b-8519-49a3-a197-2adce6b8b212" label="text-like">At Magn.</l><l xml:id="m-c4263c38-e3ac-42fc-900c-eed855ac95ce" facs="#m-5c922f87-5c24-4809-8f4f-722478181df0" label="ambiguous">Ant. S. G</l><l xml:id="m-d8e4b358-507a-47a2-bfe3-6720b574c4f8" facs="#m-41ef5aa3-a6b3-4bb1-9b01-10ba96573148" label="ambiguous">D</l><l xml:id="m-bc5cca38-53a9-4423-9b7a-36d956676892" facs="#m-3c18daa9-a204-427a-919e-c30c7a2de004" label="lyrics-like">A-ta est mí-hi “ómnis pot-éstas</l><l xml:id="m-c3bcce9d-e7c5-412d-800c-ed8a4bcd8de7" facs="#m-5352e577-dade-4f9b-b42c-4801c43f399b" label="lyrics-like">in caélo</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
